{"evidence_id": "ev-00654", "event_id": "E027", "source": "official", "platform": "www.pudong.gov.cn", "publish_time": null, "url": "https://www.pudong.gov.cn/pudong-interaction-front/consult/content/bf5c77cc135a459eb922a5899b87ff2a", "text": "您好：\n本人母亲因交通事故被起诉，后接到上海敬筑律师事务所电话。对方声称给予我母亲法律援助。我母亲于2024年6月21日前往该律师事务所（浦东新区陆家嘴福山路33号16楼A室）。对方承诺全权负责案件处理及后续问题后与我母亲订立《聘请律师合同书》，我母亲支付人民币叁仟元整。后2024年6月25日法院开庭，该律师事务所并未出席，致使我母亲在本案中未合理合法地称述观点及合理诉求。本人多次拨打浦东新区司法局电话 021-38583693进行投诉，无人接听。特来咨询投诉该律师事务所地有效方式方法。\n谢谢！", "stakeholder_hint": null, "stance_hint": null, "temporal_stage": null, "traceable": true, "source_type": "official", "legacy_text": "本人母亲因交通事故被起诉,后接到上海敬筑律师事务所电话。对方声称给予我母亲法律援助。我母亲于2024年6月21日前往该律师事务所(浦东新区陆家嘴福山路33号16楼A室)。对方承诺全权负责案件处理及后续", "fulltext_backfill_status": "ok", "fulltext_chars": 250, "fulltext_fetched_at": "2026-05-25T17:57:26.672576+00:00", "fulltext_sha256": "dc01aaf67d68258dd7537923441d3b693b2feef4967ba368e3e1e5e321740d41", "fulltext_final_url": "https://www.pudong.gov.cn/pudong-interaction-front/consult/content/bf5c77cc135a459eb922a5899b87ff2a", "fulltext_content_type": "text/html;charset=UTF-8", "usable_clean_status": "ok", "usable_clean_reason": "", "usable_text_chars": 250}
{"evidence_id": "ev-00655", "event_id": "E027", "source": "official", "platform": "www.pudong.gov.cn", "publish_time": null, "url": "https://www.pudong.gov.cn/pudong-interaction-front/consult/content/f2caabcb0eef4a5e9404c08b8242ef2d", "text": "为什么浦东新区眼病牙病防治所不在二级医疗机构的名单中？ 其他区牙防所都在二级医疗机构的名单中，就浦东新区没有，浦东新区眼病牙病防治所到底属于什么级别的医院？", "stakeholder_hint": null, "stance_hint": null, "temporal_stage": null, "traceable": true, "source_type": "official", "legacy_text": "医院已电话联系市民,解释具体原因,同时告知在国家医保服务平台可以查询浦东新区眼病牙病防治所医保等级。(先行联系与答复录音已上传)", "fulltext_backfill_status": "ok", "fulltext_chars": 78, "fulltext_fetched_at": "2026-05-25T17:57:26.672576+00:00", "fulltext_sha256": "069d8820ac587b5743458f5c925889496f667f8fb6a183ae922129a991dac87e", "fulltext_final_url": "https://www.pudong.gov.cn/pudong-interaction-front/consult/content/f2caabcb0eef4a5e9404c08b8242ef2d", "fulltext_content_type": "text/html;charset=UTF-8", "usable_clean_status": "ok", "usable_clean_reason": "", "usable_text_chars": 78}
