{"evidence_id": "ev-00976", "event_id": "E039", "source": "news", "platform": "www.sohu.com", "publish_time": null, "url": "https://www.sohu.com/a/763881410_698473", "text": "3月13日7时54分，一燕郊网友的行车记录仪记录下了爆燃事故的全程。三河市应急管理局通报，爆燃事故疑似燃气泄漏引发。有网友发视频称发生二次爆炸，请围观群众迅速撤离！返回搜狐，查看更多", "stakeholder_hint": null, "stance_hint": null, "temporal_stage": null, "traceable": true, "source_type": "mainstream_news", "legacy_text": "3月13日7时54分,一燕郊网友的行车记录仪记录下了爆燃事故的全程。三河市应急管理局通报,爆燃事故疑似燃气泄漏引发。有网友发视频称发生二次爆炸,请围观群众迅速撤离!", "fulltext_backfill_status": "ok", "fulltext_chars": 91, "fulltext_fetched_at": "2026-05-25T17:57:26.672576+00:00", "fulltext_sha256": "78d23b0b556af53f8f181820093919ff7bbb92ff3490b689ade63f7f1f8b4d00", "fulltext_final_url": "https://www.sohu.com/a/763881410_698473", "fulltext_content_type": "text/html;charset=UTF-8", "usable_clean_status": "ok", "usable_clean_reason": "", "usable_text_chars": 91}
