{"evidence_id": "ev-02061", "event_id": "E045", "source": "public_web", "platform": "m.dianping.com", "publish_time": null, "url": "https://m.dianping.com/ugcdetail/217205100?bizType=29&msource=baiduappugc&sceneType=0", "text": "「东湖生态旅游风景区」 交通: 公交701到达东湖公园门口。 地铁8号线到省博站,再步行一段。 公园很大,风景很美。 适合附近的居民散步,遛娃。 适合大学生们踏青,亲子游和野餐…..", "stakeholder_hint": null, "stance_hint": null, "temporal_stage": null, "traceable": true, "source_type": "public_web", "legacy_text": "「东湖生态旅游风景区」 交通:      公交701到达东湖公园门口。     地铁8号线到省博站,再步行一段。 公园很大,风景很美。 适合附近的居民散步,遛娃。 适合大学生们踏青,亲子游和野餐…..", "fulltext_backfill_status": "ok", "fulltext_chars": 14, "fulltext_fetched_at": "2026-05-25T17:57:26.672576+00:00", "fulltext_sha256": "2b6a706ac3e3d2af5f20311ce31468aaa01037142b96e906c22ef36b550fb879", "fulltext_final_url": "https://m.dianping.com/ugcdetail/217205100?bizType=29&msource=baiduappugc&sceneType=0", "fulltext_content_type": "text/html;charset=utf-8", "unusable_fulltext": "-大众点评\n去查看\n相关推荐", "usable_clean_status": "repaired_from_legacy_text", "usable_clean_reason": "too_short", "usable_text_chars": 91}
